{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-137":{"renderings":[{"id":"39456edfbd52c8a6","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Used with certain emotional/mental verbs to show a strong, unceasing emotion: 'can't stop', 'never cease to'."},{"id":"f5fbb02409b4f65a","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The grammar ～てやまない is typically used with verbs like 願う, 祈る, 愛する, 尊敬する, 期待する, etc., expressing a deep, continuous emotional state (love, respect, hope, prayer). It emphasizes that the feeling 'never ceases.'"},{"id":"b8f9014298a22feb","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-て form + やまない (common with certain verbs)"},{"id":"49b7a431a728f84a","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Formal, literary \"never cease to...\" - a strong, unceasing emotion, used with a narrow set of verbs (hope, love, wish)."},{"id":"140b3ceb8a829c1f","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"cant-help-but"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Can't Help But (Overwhelming Feeling)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"cant-help-but"}}]},"n1-137#bf143a2898ae":{"renderings":[{"id":"35b5c29e691b6eb0","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I can't stop thinking of my mother."}]},"n1-137#c2e984752562":{"renderings":[{"id":"9de56f6b6ef2d5c3","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He loves her beyond measure."}]},"n1-137#6d7c6863e8b3":{"renderings":[{"id":"93eb79cbac8c1b77","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He has unceasing respect for Japanese culture."}]},"n1-137#e2376a26e68b":{"renderings":[{"id":"2d289bb6fde8d379","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-137"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I can’t stop hoping for her success."}]}}}